    <section anchor="examples-in-rfc-5451" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-appendix.a">
      <name slugifiedName="name-examples-in-rfc-5451">Examples in RFC 5451</name>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-1">It should be noted that this update also applies to the examples in
<xref target="AUTHRES" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="AUTHRES"/>, specifically the one in Appendix B.5.  The error there
<xref target="ERR2818" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="ERR2818"/> is not corrected by this update, which only deals with the
normative portions of that specification and the related IANA
registrations.  However, it is assumed one could easily see what
needs to be corrected there.</t>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-2">Corrected examples will be included in a full update to <xref target="AUTHRES" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="AUTHRES"/> at
some future time.</t>
    </section>
